      "evidence": "app.put('/upload/:name', ...)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The endpoint lacks rate limiting, making it susceptible to Denial of Service (DoS) attacks via rapid file uploads.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware to restrict the number of requests per IP."
